    "type": "game",
    "name": "Walter's Adventure",
    "steam_appid": 3681830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the role of Walter, the only one brave villager, to recover the stolen treasure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/3ea55ddb3834a24cea5cd36400fa5a54.avif?t=1754844622\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, avoid obstacles and eliminate enemies by landing on their heads!  Collect gems, which you exchange for everything available in the game.   Customize your character by choosing from a variety of passive and active skills.  Do everything in your power to return the stone to its place!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/e881b0d9ca7adcf4b4f321752b83c531.avif?t=1754844622\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you traverse the levels you have the chance to find a wishing fountain where you can upgrade your character, you can upgrade almost every thing about your character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/90d2a827449fd17630706fbaa877ed4c.avif?t=1754844622\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From buying skills that will help you in various situations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By upgrading these skills or a regular character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/2a90ddbc27ef1ea2c8804c1614f1a9bd.avif?t=1754844622\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As far as unlocking passive skills that other skins have.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all this for currency earned in the game, with no micropayments or premium currencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Avoid deadly traps on each map, those visible and those hard to see.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each level is filled with a mass of obstacles, creatures and hindrances that are just waiting for you to be the one to die on them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember, your character will have something to say after the death you've led to.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not necessarily a nice one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retrieve the teleportation stones and become the hero of your village!And most importantly, remember to have fun, because that's what games are for.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the role of Walter, the only one brave villager, to recover the stolen treasure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/3ea55ddb3834a24cea5cd36400fa5a54.avif?t=1754844622\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, avoid obstacles and eliminate enemies by landing on their heads!  Collect gems, which you exchange for everything available in the game.   Customize your character by choosing from a variety of passive and active skills.  Do everything in your power to return the stone to its place!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/e881b0d9ca7adcf4b4f321752b83c531.avif?t=1754844622\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you traverse the levels you have the chance to find a wishing fountain where you can upgrade your character, you can upgrade almost every thing about your character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/90d2a827449fd17630706fbaa877ed4c.avif?t=1754844622\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From buying skills that will help you in various situations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By upgrading these skills or a regular character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/2a90ddbc27ef1ea2c8804c1614f1a9bd.avif?t=1754844622\" data-has-big width=800 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As far as unlocking passive skills that other skins have.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all this for currency earned in the game, with no micropayments or premium currencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Avoid deadly traps on each map, those visible and those hard to see.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each level is filled with a mass of obstacles, creatures and hindrances that are just waiting for you to be the one to die on them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember, your character will have something to say after the death you've led to.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not necessarily a nice one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retrieve the teleportation stones and become the hero of your village!And most importantly, remember to have fun, because that's what games are for.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2>",
    "short_description": "Play the role of the Walter. The only brave member of his village, tasked with recovering the teleportation stones that were stolen from you. Travel through various levels, defeat enemies and upgrade your character. Do everything to recover what was stolen from you.",
